Oops! Someone pointed out that "You feel unworthy" was not a response
to a second prayer.  Here's the gen:
When you are made into a hero (or avatar or whatever you want to call
them), you are given a special weapon.  For the Envoy of Balance, it's
Vorpal Blade.
If you're already wielding a weapon of the right type, your god will
try to turn it into your special weapon instead of giving you a new one.
Frost Brand, like Vorpal Sword, is a longsword.  So Crom tried to turn
it into Vorpal Blade.  But since it was already an artifact weapon, he
couldn't.  "You feel unworthy" is the message it gives you when your god
tries to give you a weapon but fails.

